{"code":"ja","name":"Japanese","native":"日本語","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"B1","level":{"title":"Intermediate: plain forms, potential, family, opinions","goals":["Use ない-form, potential and たいです","Talk family with correct politeness","Argue opinions and describe weather"],"units":[{"id":"B1-U1","title":"Plain forms and ability","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U1-L1","title":"ない-form: たべない","learn":"Plain negative! たべない (don't eat), のまない, いかない, しない. Friends use plain forms! Reason with から/ので (because): つかれたので、ねます = Because I'm tired, I sleep!","vocab":[{"t":"たべない","r":"tabenai","en":"don't eat","pos":"verb"},{"t":"のまない","r":"nomanai","en":"don't drink","pos":"verb"},{"t":"いかない","r":"ikanai","en":"don't go","pos":"verb"},{"t":"しない","r":"shinai","en":"don't do","pos":"verb"},{"t":"こない","r":"konai","en":"don't come","pos":"verb"},{"t":"わからない","r":"wakaranai","en":"don't understand","pos":"verb"},{"t":"から","r":"kara","en":"because","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"ので","r":"node","en":"since / because","pos":"conjunction"}],"grammar":{"title":"ない + から/ので","explain":"たべない (don't eat), たべなかった (didn't eat). Reason: つかれたのでねます (since tired, sleep). ので is softer than から!","pattern":"ない/なかった · ので/から + result","examples":[{"t":"いま、たべない。","r":"ima, tabenai.","en":"I don't eat now. (plain)"},{"t":"きのう、いかなかった。","r":"kinou, ikanakatta.","en":"Yesterday I didn't go."},{"t":"つかれたので、ねます。","r":"tsukareta-node, nemasu.","en":"Since I'm tired, I sleep."}],"mistakes":["Using plain ない with teachers — use ません politely!","Saying ので at sentence START — reason comes first!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ゆき","t":"いっしょにたべない?","r":"issho-ni tabenai?","en":"Won't you eat together? (won't you join?)"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"ごめん、つかれたので、ねます。","r":"gomen, tsukareta-node, nemasu.","en":"Sorry, since I'm tired, I sleep."},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"わかった! おやすみ!","r":"wakatta! oyasumi!","en":"Got it! Good night!"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"おやすみ!","r":"oyasumi!","en":"Good night!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (plain): I don't eat","answer":"たべない"},{"type":"fill","q":"きのう、いか___。 (didn't go, plain)","answer":"なかった"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Since I'm tired, I sleep' is…","options":["つかれて、ねます","つかれたので、ねます","つかれるから、ねた","つかれたいので、ねます"],"answer":"つかれたので、ねます"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: たべない / いま","answer":"いまたべない"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: つかれたので、ねます。","answer":"つかれたので、ねます。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"たべない is…","options":["polite negative","plain negative","past","command"],"answer":1,"why":"ない = plain negative."},{"q":"いかなかった means…","options":["don't go","didn't go","won't go","can't go"],"answer":1,"why":"なかった = plain past-negative."},{"q":"ので links…","options":["two nouns","reason → result","questions","commands"],"answer":1,"why":"つかれたので、ねます."},{"q":"わからない means…","options":["I know","I don't understand","I forgot","I remember"],"answer":1,"why":"わからない = don't get it."},{"q":"Plain forms are for…","options":["teachers","friends","bosses","strangers"],"answer":1,"why":"Friends = plain; others = ます!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"ない-form worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["don't eat","don't go","because"],"key":["たべない","いかない","から / ので"]},{"instruction":"Plain negatives.","items":["I don't eat","Yesterday I didn't go","Since I'm tired, I sleep"],"key":["たべない","きのう、いかなかった","つかれたので、ねます"]},{"instruction":"Invite.","items":["Won't you eat together?","Good night!"],"key":["いっしょにたべない","おやすみ"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U1-L2","title":"Can and want: できる/たい","learn":"Ability! できる (can do), たべられる (can eat), はなせる (can speak). Desire: たべたいです (I want to eat)! たい + です for polite wanting. およげます = I can swim!","vocab":[{"t":"できる","r":"dekiru","en":"can do","pos":"verb"},{"t":"たべられる","r":"taberareru","en":"can eat","pos":"verb"},{"t":"はなせる","r":"hanaseru","en":"can speak","pos":"verb"},{"t":"およげる","r":"oyogeru","en":"can swim","pos":"verb"},{"t":"わかる","r":"wakaru","en":"to understand","pos":"verb"},{"t":"たい","r":"tai","en":"want to","pos":"suffix"},{"t":"ほしい","r":"hoshii","en":"want (thing)","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"たのしみ","r":"tanoshimi","en":"looking forward","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"Potential + たいです","explain":"たべられる (can eat), のめる (can drink). Want-to: たべたいです (I want to eat), いきたいです (I want to go). たい for actions, ほしい for THINGS!","pattern":"potential verb · verb-stem + たいです","examples":[{"t":"にほんごがはなせます。","r":"nihongo-ga hanasemasu.","en":"I can speak Japanese."},{"t":"すしがたべたいです!","r":"sushi-ga tabetai desu!","en":"I want to eat sushi!"},{"t":"たのしみです!","r":"tanoshimi desu!","en":"I'm looking forward to it!"}],"mistakes":["Saying たべたいます — たい is adjective: たべたいです!","Saying すしをたべたい — wants take が!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"たろう","t":"にほんごがはなせますか?","r":"nihongo-ga hanasemasu ka?","en":"Can you speak Japanese?"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"はい、すこしはなせます!","r":"hai, sukoshi hanasemasu!","en":"Yes, I can speak a little!"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"すごい! なにがたべたいですか?","r":"sugoi! nani-ga tabetai desu ka?","en":"Amazing! What do you want to eat?"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"すしがたべたいです!","r":"sushi-ga tabetai desu!","en":"I want to eat sushi!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I can speak Japanese","answer":"にほんごがはなせます"},{"type":"fill","q":"すしがたべ___です。 (want to)","answer":"たい"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I want to eat sushi' is…","options":["すしをたべたいです","すしがたべたいです","すしをたべますたい","すしがたべるたい"],"answer":"すしがたべたいです"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: はなせます / にほんごが","answer":"にほんごがはなせます"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: すしがたべたいです!","answer":"すしがたべたいです!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"はなせます means…","options":["speak (habit)","can speak","want speak","spoke"],"answer":1,"why":"Potential = can."},{"q":"たべたいです means…","options":["I eat","I want to eat","I can eat","I ate"],"answer":1,"why":"たい = want-to."},{"q":"たい is for…","options":["things","actions","places","people"],"answer":1,"why":"たべたい = want-to-eat."},{"q":"ほしい is for…","options":["actions","things","places","verbs"],"answer":1,"why":"みずがほしい = want water."},{"q":"およげる means…","options":["can run","can swim","can sing","can dance"],"answer":1,"why":"およげる = can swim."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Can and want worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["can do","want to","looking forward"],"key":["できる","たい","たのしみ"]},{"instruction":"Abilities and desires.","items":["I can speak Japanese","I want to eat sushi","I'm looking forward to it"],"key":["にほんごがはなせます","すしがたべたいです","たのしみです"]},{"instruction":"Offer.","items":["What do you want to eat?","A little!"],"key":["なにがたべたいですか","すこし"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U2","title":"Family and age","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U2-L1","title":"Family: かぞく","learn":"Family words DOUBLE! MY family (humble): ちち (father), はは (mother). YOUR family (polite): おとうさん, おかあさん. Siblings: きょうだい (brothers), しまい (sisters). りょうしん = parents!","vocab":[{"t":"かぞく","r":"kazoku","en":"family","pos":"noun"},{"t":"おとうさん","r":"otousan","en":"father (polite)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"おかあさん","r":"okaasan","en":"mother (polite)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"きょうだい","r":"kyoudai","en":"brothers / siblings","pos":"noun"},{"t":"しまい","r":"shimai","en":"sisters","pos":"noun"},{"t":"むすこ","r":"musuko","en":"son","pos":"noun"},{"t":"むすめ","r":"musume","en":"daughter","pos":"noun"},{"t":"りょうしん","r":"ryoushin","en":"parents","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"Humble vs polite family","explain":"MY father: ちち. YOUR father: おとうさん. Never call your own father おとうさん to outsiders — humble INSIDE, polite OUTSIDE!","pattern":"ちち/はは (mine) · おとうさん/おかあさん (yours)","examples":[{"t":"ちちはせんせいです。","r":"chichi-wa sensei desu.","en":"My father is a teacher."},{"t":"おとうさんは?","r":"otousan-wa?","en":"And your father?"},{"t":"かぞくはよにんです。","r":"kazoku-wa yo-nin desu.","en":"My family is four people."}],"mistakes":["Saying わたしのおとうさん to outsiders — YOUR dad is ちち!","Saying ちちは to ask about THEIR dad — theirs is おとうさん!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ゆき","t":"かぞくはなんにんですか?","r":"kazoku-wa nan-nin desu ka?","en":"How many in your family?"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"よにんです。ちちとははとわたしです。","r":"yo-nin desu. chichi-to haha-to watashi desu.","en":"Four… (3 listed +1)! Father, mother and me."},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"きょうだいがいますか?","r":"kyoudai-ga imasu ka?","en":"Do you have brothers?"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"はい、あにがいます!","r":"hai, ani-ga imasu!","en":"Yes, I have an older brother!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: My father is a teacher","answer":"ちちはせんせいです"},{"type":"fill","q":"___は? (Your father?)","answer":"おとうさん"},{"type":"choose","q":"'How many in your family?' is…","options":["かぞくはなんですか","かぞくはなんにんですか","かぞくはどこですか","かぞくはだれですか"],"answer":"かぞくはなんにんですか"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: せんせいです / ちちは","answer":"ちちはせんせいです"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ちちはせんせいです。","answer":"ちちはせんせいです。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"MY father (to outsiders) is…","options":["おとうさん","ちち","むすこ","あに"],"answer":1,"why":"Humble inside: ちち."},{"q":"YOUR father is…","options":["ちち","おとうさん","はは","おじ"],"answer":1,"why":"Polite outside: おとうさん."},{"q":"りょうしん means…","options":["brothers","parents","children","family"],"answer":1,"why":"りょうしん = parents."},{"q":"むすめ means…","options":["son","daughter","sister","mother"],"answer":1,"why":"むすめ = daughter."},{"q":"よにん means…","options":["4 things","4 people","4th","four times"],"answer":1,"why":"にん counts people."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Family worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["family","parents","daughter"],"key":["かぞく","りょうしん","むすめ"]},{"instruction":"Mine vs yours.","items":["My father is a teacher","And your father?"],"key":["ちちはせんせいです","おとうさんは"]},{"instruction":"Count family.","items":["How many in your family?","Four people"],"key":["かぞくはなんにんですか","よにんです"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U2-L2","title":"Age and birthdays: なんさい","learn":"Age: なんさいですか? (How old?) → にじゅっさいです (I'm 20). さい counts years! Birthdays: たんじょうびはいつですか? → さんがつです! Months: がつ, days: にち!","vocab":[{"t":"なんさい","r":"nan-sai","en":"how old","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"はたち","r":"hatachi","en":"20 years old","pos":"noun"},{"t":"たんじょうび","r":"tanjoubi","en":"birthday","pos":"noun"},{"t":"いつ","r":"itsu","en":"when","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"まいとし","r":"maitoshi","en":"every year","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"おいわい","r":"oiwai","en":"celebration","pos":"noun"},{"t":"プレゼント","r":"purezento","en":"present","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ケーキ","r":"keeki","en":"cake","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"さい + がつ/にち dates","explain":"にじゅっさい (20), じゅうななさい (17). Months: いちがつ (Jan), さんがつ (Mar). Days: ついたち (1st), みっか (3rd), はつか (20th)!","pattern":"number + さい · がつ · にち","examples":[{"t":"にじゅっさいです。","r":"nijus-sai desu.","en":"I'm twenty."},{"t":"たんじょうびはさんがつです。","r":"tanjoubi-wa san-gatsu desu.","en":"My birthday is March."},{"t":"おたんじょうびおめでとう!","r":"o-tanjoubi omedetou!","en":"Happy birthday!"}],"mistakes":["Saying にじゅうさい — 20 is にじゅっさい (small っ)!","Saying さんげつ — months are がつ, not げつ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"たろう","t":"なんさいですか?","r":"nan-sai desu ka?","en":"How old are you?"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"にじゅっさいです!","r":"nijus-sai desu!","en":"I'm twenty!"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"たんじょうびはいつですか?","r":"tanjoubi-wa itsu desu ka?","en":"When is your birthday?"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"さんがつです!","r":"san-gatsu desu!","en":"It's March!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I'm twenty","answer":"にじゅっさいです"},{"type":"fill","q":"たんじょうびは___です。 (March)","answer":"さんがつ"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Happy birthday!' is…","options":["あけましておめでとう","おたんじょうびおめでとう","おめでとうございます","がんばって"],"answer":"おたんじょうびおめでとう"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ですか / なんさい","answer":"なんさいですか"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: にじゅっさいです。","answer":"にじゅっさいです。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"にじゅっさい means…","options":["12","20","22","10"],"answer":1,"why":"にじゅっさい = 20 years."},{"q":"さんがつ means…","options":["March","3 days","3 years","May"],"answer":0,"why":"さん + がつ = March."},{"q":"たんじょうび means…","options":["age","birthday","year","party"],"answer":1,"why":"たんじょうび = birthday."},{"q":"いつ means…","options":["where","when","who","how"],"answer":1,"why":"いつ = when."},{"q":"まいとし means…","options":["every day","every year","last year","next year"],"answer":1,"why":"まいとし = every year."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Age worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["how old","birthday","present"],"key":["なんさい","たんじょうび","プレゼント"]},{"instruction":"Ages and dates.","items":["I'm twenty","My birthday is March","Happy birthday!"],"key":["にじゅっさいです","たんじょうびはさんがつです","おたんじょうびおめでとう"]},{"instruction":"Ask.","items":["How old are you?","When is your birthday?"],"key":["なんさいですか","たんじょうびはいつですか"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U3","title":"Opinions and weather","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U3-L1","title":"Opinions: とおもいます","learn":"Think out loud! とおもいます (I think that…): ちかてつはべんりだとおもいます! Compare: もっと (more), いちばん (most): これがいちばんいいです = This is the best!","vocab":[{"t":"おもう","r":"omou","en":"to think","pos":"verb"},{"t":"かんがえる","r":"kangaeru","en":"to consider","pos":"verb"},{"t":"よい","r":"yoi","en":"good","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"わるい","r":"warui","en":"bad","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"もっと","r":"motto","en":"more","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"いちばん","r":"ichiban","en":"most / best","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"いけん","r":"iken","en":"opinion","pos":"noun"},{"t":"さんせい","r":"sansei","en":"agreement","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"とおもいます + もっと/いちばん","explain":"ちかてつがいいとおもいます (I think the subway is good). Plain-form + とおもいます! もっとおおきい (bigger), いちばんいい (the best)!","pattern":"plain + とおもいます · もっと/いちばん","examples":[{"t":"ちかてつがいいとおもいます。","r":"chikatetsu-ga ii-to omoimasu.","en":"I think the subway is good."},{"t":"これはもっとおおきいです。","r":"kore-wa motto ookii desu.","en":"This is bigger."},{"t":"これがいちばんいいです!","r":"kore-ga ichiban ii desu!","en":"This is the best!"}],"mistakes":["Saying ですとおもいます — plain + と: だとおもいます!","Saying もっといちばん — pick ONE: もっと or いちばん!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ゆき","t":"ちかてつがいいとおもいます。","r":"chikatetsu-ga ii-to omoimasu.","en":"I think the subway is good."},{"sp":"たろう","t":"わたしはくるまがはやいとおもいます。","r":"watashi-wa kuruma-ga hayai-to omoimasu.","en":"I think the car is fast."},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"でも、ちかてつはもっとやすいです!","r":"demo, chikatetsu-wa motto yasui desu!","en":"But the subway is cheaper!"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"さんせいです!","r":"sansei desu!","en":"I agree!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I think the subway is good","answer":"ちかてつがいいとおもいます"},{"type":"fill","q":"これが___いいです! (most)","answer":"いちばん"},{"type":"choose","q":"'This is bigger' is…","options":["これはおおきいいです","これはもっとおおきいです","これはいちばんおおきいです","これはおおきいとおもいます"],"answer":"これはもっとおおきいです"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: とおもいます / ちかてつがいい","answer":"ちかてつがいいとおもいます"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ちかてつがいいとおもいます。","answer":"ちかてつがいいとおもいます。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"とおもいます attaches to…","options":["ます-form","plain-form","て-form","past only"],"answer":1,"why":"いいとおもいます — plain + と."},{"q":"もっと means…","options":["most","more","best","less"],"answer":1,"why":"もっと = more."},{"q":"いちばん means…","options":["more","most","first time","number one only"],"answer":1,"why":"いちばん = most/best."},{"q":"わるい means…","options":["good","bad","big","small"],"answer":1,"why":"わるい = bad."},{"q":"さんせいです means…","options":["I disagree","I agree","maybe","never"],"answer":1,"why":"さんせい = agreement."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Opinions worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["to think","more","opinion"],"key":["おもう","もっと","いけん"]},{"instruction":"Think and compare.","items":["I think the subway is good","This is bigger","This is the best"],"key":["ちかてつがいいとおもいます","これはもっとおおきいです","これがいちばんいいです"]},{"instruction":"Debate.","items":["But the subway is cheaper!","I agree!"],"key":["でも、ちかてつはもっとやすいです","さんせいです"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U3-L2","title":"Weather: てんき","learn":"Weather talk! てんきはどうですか? (How's the weather?) → さむいです (It's cold). あめがふります (It rains), ゆきがふります (It snows). い-adjectives conjugate: さむかった (was cold)!","vocab":[{"t":"てんき","r":"tenki","en":"weather","pos":"noun"},{"t":"たいよう","r":"taiyou","en":"sun","pos":"noun"},{"t":"あめ","r":"ame","en":"rain","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ゆき","r":"yuki","en":"snow","pos":"noun"},{"t":"さむい","r":"samui","en":"cold","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"あつい","r":"atsui","en":"hot","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"あたたかい","r":"atatakai","en":"warm","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"かぜ","r":"kaze","en":"wind","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"い-adjectives: さむい→さむかった","explain":"さむい (cold), さむかった (was cold), さむくない (not cold). あめがふります (rain falls = it rains). あしたはあたたかいです (tomorrow is warm)!","pattern":"い → かった/くない · がふります","examples":[{"t":"きょうはさむいです。","r":"kyou-wa samui desu.","en":"Today is cold."},{"t":"あめがふります。","r":"ame-ga furimasu.","en":"It rains."},{"t":"きのうはさむかったです。","r":"kinou-wa samukatta desu.","en":"Yesterday was cold."}],"mistakes":["Saying さむいでした — い-adjectives: さむかったです!","Saying あめをふります — rain needs が!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"たろう","t":"てんきはどうですか?","r":"tenki-wa dou desu ka?","en":"How is the weather?"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"さむいです! ゆきがふります!","r":"samui desu! yuki-ga furimasu!","en":"It's cold! It's snowing!"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"あしたはあたたかいですか?","r":"ashita-wa atatakai desu ka?","en":"Will it be warm tomorrow?"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"はい! さんぽしましょう!","r":"hai! sanpo-shimashou!","en":"Yes! Let's take a walk!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: It rains","answer":"あめがふります"},{"type":"fill","q":"きょうは___です。 (cold)","answer":"さむい"},{"type":"choose","q":"'How is the weather?' is…","options":["てんきはなんですか","てんきはどうですか","てんきはどこですか","てんきはいつですか"],"answer":"てんきはどうですか"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ふります / あめが","answer":"あめがふります"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: さむいです! ゆきがふります!","answer":"さむいです! ゆきがふります!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"あめがふります means…","options":["it snows","it rains","it's windy","it's sunny"],"answer":1,"why":"ふります = falls."},{"q":"さむかった means…","options":["is cold","was cold","not cold","will cold"],"answer":1,"why":"かった = past."},{"q":"あしたはあたたかい means…","options":["today warm","tomorrow warm","yesterday warm","always warm"],"answer":1,"why":"あした = tomorrow."},{"q":"い-adjective past: い→…","options":["くない","かった","でした","ます"],"answer":1,"why":"さむい→さむかった."},{"q":"ゆき means…","options":["rain","snow","wind","sun"],"answer":1,"why":"ゆき = snow."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Weather worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["weather","snow","cold"],"key":["てんき","ゆき","さむい"]},{"instruction":"Report weather.","items":["It rains","Today is cold","Yesterday was cold"],"key":["あめがふります","きょうはさむいです","きのうはさむかったです"]},{"instruction":"Ask and plan.","items":["How is the weather?","Let's take a walk!"],"key":["てんきはどうですか","さんぽしましょう"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"B1 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (plain): I don't eat","answer":"たべない"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I can speak Japanese","answer":"にほんごがはなせます"},{"type":"choose","q":"'My father is a teacher' (to outsiders)","options":["わたしのおとうさんはせんせいです","ちちはせんせいです","おとうさんはせんせいです","ちちがせんせいがいます"],"answer":"ちちはせんせいです"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"さむいです! ゆきがふります!","answer":"It's cold! It's snowing!"},{"type":"fill","q":"すしがたべ___です。 (want to)","answer":"たい"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Since I'm tired, I sleep'","options":["つかれて、ねます","つかれたので、ねます","つかれるから、ねた","つかれたいので、ねます"],"answer":"つかれたので、ねます"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ふります / あめが","answer":"あめがふります"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ちかてつがいいとおもいます。","answer":"ちかてつがいいとおもいます。"},{"type":"fill","q":"これが___いいです! (most)","answer":"いちばん"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I think the subway is good","answer":"ちかてつがいいとおもいます"}]}}}